A||||4||daved||New Struts for 86GT. Anyone cut the metal shield off to match original ?||||1||
Z||000000||daved||12-01-2001||09:55 PM||||I guess the subject says it all.  The Monroe Sensatrac's I bought look like front wheel drive GM's.  They have a shield off the spring perch that is not present in the original equipment.  Otherwise they appear to fit.  Any value in cutting this off?  Any harm in it?  <BR>I'd prefer them to look like the originals, and the shield comes very close to the tires.  <BR>Anyone know what their purpose is?||||reg||1
Z||000001||2birds||12-01-2001||10:20 PM||||My Monroe Gas-matics have a shield on them.  Not sure what the OEM struts had, though (been 12 years since I changed them).  I have 225/60-15's on the back, and have no problems, though.||||reg||1
Z||000002||theogre||12-02-2001||12:58 PM||||Sheild? what shield?<P>I just put Gabriel Gas Ryders on back of mine... nothing but spring perch on them. almost identical to OE.<P>The tires only need enough clearance that they can't rub the perch.<P>If you think it's too close you may be able to simply bend it back some. can't really say for sure. never seen a strut with anything but a spring perch there....<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fierowrecker||12-02-2001||02:44 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by daved:<BR><B>I guess the subject says it all.  The Monroe Sensatrac's I bought look like front wheel drive GM's.  They have a shield off the spring perch that is not present in the original equipment.  Otherwise they appear to fit.  Any value in cutting this off?  Any harm in it?  <BR>I'd prefer them to look like the originals, and the shield comes very close to the tires.  <BR>Anyone know what their purpose is?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>My Monroes also had the shield, left it on...<BR>crash...<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Mr.Frosty||12-02-2001||06:48 PM||||I bought Gabriel for the back of mine.They came with shields to be screwed on.I left them off.They were huge.No problems though.<P>------------------<BR>85 GT Turbo intercooled||||reg||1
